mous with the  character even with the mixed reception  to 2016 suicide squad many fans were  thrilled by margot robbie's portrayal of  harley quinn she went on to appear in  her own spin-off and james gunns a  suicide squad sequel and she's won  praise for her performances each and  every time while it may be hard to  imagine another actress taking over the  role it's important to remember just how  many actors have played the joker over  the years phoenix still managed to blow  audiences away and nab a best actor  academy award for his 2019 performance  even though the role had previously been  brought to the screen by a number of  other actors robbie herself suggested at  one point that she needed a break from  the role of quinn in the run-up to the  release of the suicide squad however she  suggested she's ready for more are you  gonna take a little break from harley no  i've had enough of the break i'm ready  to do her again of course if gaga does  play harley in the joker sequel she  would not be a full replacement for  robbie because robbie's quinn exists in  the dc eu gaga would simply represent  another version of quinn from dc's  expanding multiverse lady gaga's  involvement isn't the only revelation to  come out about joker foley ado however  according to the hollywood reporter the  movie could also end up being a musical  it would certainly be an original way to  follow up the original and todd phillips  gamble paying off for the first movie  likely gave warner brothers some faith  in trying something different this time  around while it wasn't a musical philips  and gaga have worked on a music heavy  movie in the past phillips was a  producer on bradley cooper's a star is  born the oscar-winning film that also  gave gaga a hit with shallow well the  joker foley ado does end up being a  full-blown musical or not though gaga's  inclusion at least opens a possibility  of including some kind of fitting  musical element and hey we already know  phoenix's joker can dance so this really  could be a match made in heaven or at  least whatever arkham asylum version of  heaven might be  check out one of our newest videos right  here plus even more looper videos about  your favorite movies and tv shows are  coming soon subscribe to our youtube  channel and hit the bell so you don't  miss a single one  [Music]
 

